    {"id":"void","name":"作废两站开路轮次","entry":"POST /wafers/{id}/rounds/{rid}/voids","steps":["确认两站均为开路","作废本轮并保留父量测"],"module_ids":["http","intake","storage","timeline"],"success":"两次开路留证，格点继续阻签","failure":"有可终判来件时不允许作废","verification":"python3 -B -m tools.smoke --through round_void"},
    {"id":"compare","name":"比较同片两版","entry":"GET .../compare/{old}/{new}","steps":["复算确认两个封存件","按物理坐标标记变档和来源变化"],"module_ids":["http","archive","sorter","timeline"],"success":"返回真正发生变化的点及来源","failure":"倒序版本拒绝","verification":"python3 -B -m tools.smoke --through compare"}
